<title>USA: U.S. wheat, corn and barley export inspections.</title>
<headline>U.S. wheat, corn and barley export inspections.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Agriculture Department said the 25.241 million bushels of wheat, 25.063 million bushels of corn and 473,000 of barley inspected for export in the week ended Aug 29 were for the following shipment from port areas or inland inspection points (1,000 bu).</p>
<p>	     Wheat     Corn	Barley</p>
<p> Lakes	 354	Nil	  Nil</p>
<p> Atlantic    Nil	Nil	  Nil</p>
<p> Gulf	9,632   22,392	  Nil</p>
<p> Pacific  14,949    2,603	  473</p>
<p> Interior    306	 68	  Nil</p>
